## HaborTech Ticket Summary
* The client was able to access AWS Academy and able to use the learner with normal functions. 
## Client Impact
* Client unable to access AWS Academy and learner lab would further effect their ability to advance in the curriculum and be detrimental to GPA. The work would come to full stop without full readiness as the intern would not be able to complete daily duties.
## AWS Services Involved
* AWS Academy course including AWS Academy Cloud Operations and AWS Academy Learner lab. Parameters surrounding IAM, Region lock, account specification, and documentation within a professional and organizational structure. 
## Virtualization Connection
* Certain features such as EC2 are only available within the account or the root account. The same goes where you cannot run some services within the region. Often times going outside of these boundaries restrict permission and drive up the cost to expand. The platform that the virtualization is founded on can have restriction that 
goes with that. 
